+- Nits ×5 all fixed (corrections, not optional): adr-0076-wiring L1 header,
+  adr-0069-wiring:305 test name, t16 handoff 1412×2 + "D-E" mislabel,
+  spec §3 member-list overclaim, report F-C wording.
